flowchart TD
    A[Customer browses available vehicles] --> B[Select vehicle and rental dates]
    B --> C[Submit rental request]
    C --> D[Staff reviews request]
    D --> E{Vehicle available for dates?}
    E -->|No| F[Reject request / suggest another vehicle]
    F --> A
    E -->|Yes| G[Confirm booking]
    G --> H[Create rental record]
    H --> I[Set vehicle status to RENTED when rental begins]
    I --> J[Customer returns vehicle]
    J --> K[Staff inspects vehicle]
    K --> M[Create return record]
    M --> N[Calculate final bill and record payment]
    N --> O[Mark rental COMPLETED]
    O --> P[Set vehicle status to AVAILABLE if serviceable]
    P --> Q[Update dashboard and reports]
